00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:47.930
the closet plant.
“壁橱植物”。

511
00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:54.350
I found out it is very popular in homes and offices because they don't need a ton of light
我发现它在家庭和办公室里很受欢迎，因为它们不需要太多的光照

512
00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:55.110
or water.
或水分。

