Because most of it is like an outdoor nursery.
因为大部分地方看起来像个室外苗圃。

546
00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:17.210
And they sassed me and said, no, it would be in the indoor section because it's an indoor
他们没好气地对我说，不，它应该在室内区域，因为它是一种室内

547
00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:17.730
