00:26:00.490 --> 00:26:03.210
It's like a three-story, like, birdhouse.
它就像个三层楼高的鸟屋。

619
00:26:04.770 --> 00:26:08.050
It looks like a combo mailbox and birdhouse.
看起来既是邮箱又是鸟屋。

620
00:26:08.290 --> 00:26:08.530
It is!
确实是！

621
00:26:08.530 --> 00:26:11.110
If I were a bird, I wouldn't want to move into that.
如果我是只鸟，我才不想搬进去住。

622
00:26:11.250 --> 00:26:11.830
It feels...
感觉……

623
00:26:11.830 --> 00:26:12.490
