Also, though, will I just have, like, bird poop on my mail?
而且，我的信上会不会全是鸟屎？

626
00:26:23.810 --> 00:26:24.730
I don't know.
我不知道。

627
00:26:24.730 --> 00:26:29.230
I guess Jim walks out of his office and notices that there's a bunch of people missing.
我想吉姆走出办公室时发现很多人不见了。

628
00:26:29.530 --> 00:26:30.590
Where are they?
他们去哪了？

629
00:26:30.770 --> 00:26:31.490
I don't know.
我不知道。

630
00:26:31.730 --> 00:26:33.770
Maybe I'll go see what Michael's up to.
也许我该去看看迈克尔在干什么。

631
00:26:33.970 --> 00:26:36.970
And he's having a sneaky meeting.
他正在开一个秘密会议。

632
00:26:37.810 --> 00:26:38.410
Yeah.
是啊。

633
00:26:38.810 --> 00:26:44.370
